      "ruleset": "bc",
      "stage": "disgrace",
      "order": 6,
      "key": "greed",
      "cost": 0,
      "description": "<p>Often, when this character sees something novel, he is overcome by a passion to possess it. The item in question need not be useful, but the compulsion is much stronger if it is unique or rare. This urge may even overcome the necessities of a task at hand.</p>",
