      "order": 4,
      "key": "immortality",
      "cost": 0,
      "description": "<p>The character fears death in all its varied forms, or simply desires to live for eternity. To overcome this, he is willing to take whatever means are necessary to insure his continued survival; the means might be mechanical, warp spawned, or some unholy combination of the two.</p>",
