      "order": 5,
      "key": "innovation",
      "cost": 0,
      "description": "<p>While uncovering lost knowledge is a worthy cause, it pales behind the glories of creating completely new forms of technology or psychic phenomena. This Heretic has embraced the ways of Chaos so that he might use its powers to create new tools and uncover information that was previously beyond the limitations of mortals.</p>",
